#: src/Settings/Sections/Advanced/AdvancedSection.php:93
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Depurar"

#: src/Settings/Sections/Advanced/AdvancedSection.php:94
msgid ""
"Debug mode is useful when you need to track what pricing rule is applying "
"for a cart item."
msgstr ""
"O modo de depuração é útil quando você precisa rastrear qual regra de "
"precificação está sendo aplicada a um item do carrinho."

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:15
#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:99
msgid "Calculations"
msgstr "Cálculos"

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:16
msgid "This section controls how tiered pricing does calculations."
msgstr "Esta seção controla como o preço escalonado faz os cálculos."

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:35
msgid "Combine variations for quantity calculation"
msgstr "Combine variações para cálculo de quantidade"

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:40
msgid ""
"Treat all variations of a variable product as the same item when calculating"
" the total cart quantity for tiered pricing rules."
msgstr ""
"Trate todas as variações de um produto variável como o mesmo item ao "
"calcular a quantidade total do carrinho para regras de preços escalonados."

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:45
msgid "Calculate percentage discounts from regular price"
msgstr "Calcule descontos percentuais do preço normal"

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:53
msgid "Round calculated prices"
msgstr "Preços calculados redondos"

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:57
msgid ""
"Round calculated percentage discounts to prevent minor display discrepancies"
" with standard WooCommerce pricing."
msgstr ""
"Arredonde descontos percentuais calculados para evitar pequenas "
"discrepâncias de exibição com os preços padrão do WooCommerce."

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:69
msgid ""
"Calculate percentage discounts using the product's regular price, ignoring "
"any active sale prices."
msgstr ""
"Calcule descontos percentuais usando o preço normal do produto, ignorando "
"quaisquer preços de venda ativos."

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:75
msgid ""
"Example: Regular price is $100.00, sale price is $90.00. Rule: 20% off."
msgstr ""
"Exemplo: o preço normal é $ 100,00, o preço de venda é $ 90,00. Regra: 20% "
"de desconto."

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:80
msgid ""
"Disabled (Default): Discount applies to the sale price ($90.00 - 20% = "
"$72.00)."
msgstr ""
"Desativado (padrão): O desconto se aplica ao preço de venda (US$ 90,00 - 20%"
" = US$ 72,00)."

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:85
msgid ""
"Enabled: Discount applies to the regular price ($100.00 - 20% = $80.00)."
msgstr ""
"Ativado: o desconto se aplica ao preço normal (US$ 100,00 - 20% = US$ "
"80,00)."

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:106
msgid "How global pricing rules behave."
msgstr "Como se comportam as regras globais de preços."

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:110
msgid "Prioritize global pricing rules"
msgstr "Priorize regras de preços globais"

#: src/Settings/Sections/CalculationLogic/CalculationLogic.php:112
msgid ""
"Apply global pricing rules before product-level rules. If disabled, "
"individual product rules take precedence over global rules."
msgstr ""
